MODULE: NextPumpIgnoresBatchHint
TARGET: FlowControlHonoured
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the next pump ignores the observed receiver batch clamp
PERTURBS: NextPump

--- FIND
    /\ stop' = FALSE /\ batchCap' = control.receiver /\ phase' = "fill"
--- REPLACE
    /\ stop' = FALSE /\ batchCap' = FullBatch /\ phase' = "fill"
--- END
